  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro/Guitar Tuning**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Hopefully**: back after 41 archived shows (764 days) [4]\n- **Fire Alarm (story)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Into The Woods**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2005-11-05.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 10 songs; 35 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Uploader says the uncompressed stream sounds much better than FM radio; the recording runs about 35 minutes 28 seconds; Reviewer reports excellent sound quality [1][3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer likes hearing Jim James perform the songs from a somewhat different perspective than the full band does [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2005-11-05.shnf**: taped by mjl64; transferred by nectardan; source: KEXP.org Uncompressed Stream (1411 kbps) [1]. Also: Source is KEXP's lossless WMA stream at 1411 kbps; it was available for 14 days after broadcast, capturable with NetTransport [2]",
